{"id":"bcf83fb8-d978-4246-bca9-7f8f1a26b2f2","revision":0,"last_node_id":18,"last_link_id":20,"nodes":[{"id":1,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-920,-400],"size":[920,300],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"inswapper 分步换脸说明","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"MarkdownNote"},"widgets_values":["## inswapper_128 细粒度分步（五官贴回）\n\n| 步骤 | 节点 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| ① | **对齐裁切** | 128 或 256（视模型） |\n| ② | **ONNX 换脸** | 在 swap_model 下拉切换模型 |\n| ②b | **五官蒙版预览** | 绿=五官、橙线=脸轮廓；灰度/脸区预览已接好 |\n| ③ | **五官贴回** | 只把换脸结果里的五官叠回原图（保留原脸型/肤色） |\n\n### 预览（已连线，无需改）\n- **预览 五官蒙版(绿)** ← `overlay_preview`\n- **预览 五官蒙版(灰)** ← `feature_mask_gray`\n- **预览 脸部区域** ← `face_region_mask`\n\n### ③ 节点可调\n- `include_*`：勾选要替换的五官\n- `mask_dilate_px` / `mask_blur`：消除边缘缝隙\n- `min_detection_confidence`：检测失败时回退小椭圆\n\n### 换模型\n| 模型 | 路径 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| `inswapper_128.onnx` | `models/insightface/` | 默认 |\n| `hyperswap_1a_256.onnx` | `models/hyperswap/` | 256，有时更干净 |\n\n整脸贴回（椭圆蒙版）请用节点 `ReActor ③ 贴回蒙版 (core/cheek)` 替换 ③ 节点。\n\n### 一套参数（推荐）\n②b 的 `feature_mask` → ③ `feature_mask`，`face_region_mask` → ③ `face_region_mask`。\n蒙版只在 **②b** 调；③ 保留 `warp_interpolation` / `mask_dilate_px` / `mask_blur`。"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":5,"type":"PreviewImage","pos":[-120,40],"size":[260,280],"flags":{},"order":4,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"图像","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","link":3}],"outputs":[],"title":"预览① 对齐脸块","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"PreviewImage"},"widgets_values":[]},{"id":6,"type":"ReActorSwapInfer","pos":[-480,320],"size":[320,80],"flags":{},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"align_data","name":"align_data","type":"SWAP_ALIGN_DATA","link":4}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"swapped_crop","name":"swapped_crop","type":"IMAGE","links":[5]},{"localized_name":"paste_data","name":"paste_data","type":"SWAP_PASTE_DATA","links":[6,14]}],"title":"② ONNX 换脸 (emap+128)","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"ReActorSwapInfer"},"widgets_val